 0 8cm fragment of yellow fibrofatty tissue which is serially sectioned and entirely submitted into cassettes X Y  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved medial margin  is an unoriented REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm yellow fibrofatty fragment of fibroadipose tissue which is serially sectioned and entirely submitted into cassettes Z EE  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved deep margin  are 2 unoriented fragments of yellow fibrofatty tissue  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm in aggregate which are serially sectioned and entirely submitted into cassettes FF II  Resident  PAUL MICHAELS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1 2  LYMPH NODES  SENTINEL   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  MASSIMO D APUZZO  MD PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Judith Ann Ferry  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Janey Sue Pratt  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODES  SENTINEL   EXCISION PART B  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  BREAST LEFT FINAL SHAVED SUPERIOR MARGIN  EXCISION PART D  BREAST LEFT FINAL SHAVED INFERIOR MARGIN  EXCISION PART E  BREAST LEFT FINAL SHAVED LATERAL MARGIN  EXCISION PART F  BREAST LEFT FINAL SHAVED MEDIAL MARGIN  EXCISION PART G  BREAST LEFT FINAL SHAVED DEEP MARGIN  EXCISION , Unchecked.
