ded by areas of rubbery fibrosis  In addition  there are few small nodular firm areas that come to  0 1cm from the posterior margin  Representative sections are submitted from superior to inferior in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Superior end margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass lesion with surrounding breast parenchyma and inked margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma away from the tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Inferior end margin  Received are 5 containers which are  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received fresh  labeled  anterior final margin left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm unoriented irregular piece of fibroadipose tissue  which is sectioned and submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  lateral final margin left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm aggregate of multiple unoriented pieces of fibroadipose tissue  which are sectioned and submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  superior final margin left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm aggregate of 2 unoriented pieces of fibroadipose tissue  which are sectioned and submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  medial final margin left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm piece of unoriented fibroadipose tissue  which is sectioned and submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  inferior final margin left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of multiple pieces of unoriented fibroadipose tissue  which are sectioned and submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA  SENTINEL   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on Friday REMOVED_MONTH 20   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 06 32 59PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as mak