EMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  ellipse of unremarkable skin partially covers the anterior surface  The  anterior margin is inked blue  and the posterior margin is inked black  The  specimen contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm stellate  fibrotic area in the central  to upper inner quadrant at approximately the  11 o clock  position  which abuts  the posterior margin and extends to 1 8cm from the anterior margin  The  remainder of the specimen consists of yellow  lobulated  soft adipose tissue  and gray white  rubbery tissue  Lymph nodes are not detected in the lateral  aspect  Sections are submitted as follows      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Stellate area with anterior and posterior margins    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Unremarkable fibrous tissue from the lower inner quadrant and upper  outer quadrant    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Subareolar sections with cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  containing the subareolar  margin en face    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional tissue     Unfixed  labeled  Julie Cerasulo  REMOVED_DATE  left nipple   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm nipple areolar complex with a short suture designating the superior aspect  and a long suture designating the lateral aspect  The REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  nipple is prominent  The nipple papilla is transected and submitted en face in  cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The underlying tissue is inked yellow  the lateral posterior  margin is inked black  and the medial posterior margin is inked blue  The  specimen is entirely submitted as follows      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Nipple  en face    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Remainder of specimen from superior to inferior     Unfixed  labeled  Julie Cerasulo  REMOVED_DATE  left breast skin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm piece of unremarkable skin and subcutaneous tissue  Representative sections  are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      Unfixed  labeled  Julie Cerasulo  REMOVED_DATE  right breast ski