tibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  22 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 15 40 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm portion of fibroadipose tissue  inked and sectioned to reveal breast parenchyma with a firm area of fibrosis corresponding to the x ray findings  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes A H  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  IVANA DELALLE  MD  PHD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  BENIGN  O R  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Eugene Jerome Mark  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
