 a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  THE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR PROGESTERONE RECEPTOR PROTEIN ARE FOR INVESTIGATIONAL USE ONLY  THEY MUST NOT BE USED FOR CLINICAL PURPOSES  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  08 REMOVED_MONTH 93 at 15 19 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab labeled  Right breast mass  is a breast biopsy specimen measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 3cm  and an accompanying x ray  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a tan firm area REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  which is 1 1cm from the inked margin  No frozen section is performed and the specimen is submitted entirely in A through T  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and designated  Right breast medial superior margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm fragment of fatty tissue which is submitted entirely in U and V  Resident  Jo Ann E  Haney  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  RIGHT BREAST MASS   SUSPICIOUS LESION  O R  Resident  Asif Rashid  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Max L  Goodman  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART A  RIGHT BREAST MEDIAL SUPERIOR MARGIN PART B  RIGHT BREAST MASS , Unchecked.
