ceptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  06 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 14 02 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of fibroadipose tissue  which is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm indurated firm yellow area grossly abutting the resection margin  The lesion is submitted in its entirety in cassettes A and B  Representative sections of the remainder of the tissue are submitted in cassettes C   J  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  HOWARD CHANG  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  GROSSLY CONSISTENT WITH INVASIVE CARCINOMA PRESENT AT INKED MARGIN  O R  Resident  ALEXANDER KRATZ  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Nancy Lee Harris  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
