m from the lateral margin at the axillary tail  Representative sections of the mass are submitted in A D  with A being the closest  anterior  margin  The closest posterior margin is submitted in E  The remaining breast parenchyma shows areas of fibrocystic changes  Representative sections of these areas are submitted in F G  A lymph node dissection of the axillary tail is performed  Lymph nodes are submitted as follows  H  One possible node bivalved  I  One node  bivalved  J  One node  trisected  K  Two nodes  L  Five nodes  M  three nodes  N  One node  bivalved  Resident  SARAH ROLLINS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
