ea which focally abuts the deep margin  This fibrous tissue is focally gritty and nodular with no discrete mass or induration  The remaining cut surface shows unremarkable fibrofatty breast tissue  The lateral portion of the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal possible tan pink lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 0 6cm in greatest dimension  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A B  Previous biopsy site to skin with closest deep margin as A  C D  Retracted fibrous area to deep margin  E F  Uninvolved fibrous tissue  G H  Lymph node  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  JHE                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
