cm and abuts a posterior inked margin is adjacent to the lateral stitch  and 0 5cm from the first fibrotic area  A third area  which is very ill defined consisting of firm  white fibrous tissue measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm and abuts the posterior inked margin  this area is 4 0cm superior to the first fibrotic area and is adjacent to the superior stitch  Section code  A D representative sections of the  first  fibrotic area beneath the nipple  EandF fibrotic tissue adjacent to long lateral stitch  G K representative sections of fibrous tissue in the most superior region  LandM fibrous area  measuring 0 9cm in greatest dimension intramedial to the nipple  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
