ins  Along the anterior aspect of the specimen  there is a skin ellipse measuring REMOVED_DATE x 7 5cm  In the center of the skin ellipse  there is a 3 4cm diameter areola with 0 6cm nipple  Along the medial aspect of the areola there is a periareolar scar measuring 2 4cm in length and 0 2cm in width  The scar is well healed and is several centimeters away from the closest margins  Along the upper medial aspect of the skin ellipse  there is another REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  well healed scar  This scar abuts the skin resection margin  Along the medial skin resection margin  there is a REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm area of slightly erythematous skin that abuts the resection margin  The deep resection margin consists of tan yellow  grossly unremarkable adipose tissue  The anterior resection margin is inked blue  the posterior black  The specimen is serially sectioned from lateral to medial to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm area of tan white  slightly firm fibrous tissue that comes to within 0 5cm of the deep margin  This fibrous area is relatively well circumscribed  Within the fibrous area  there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  slightly hemorrhagic area that is at 3 5cm from the deep margin and comes to within 2 0cm of the closest anterior deep resection margin  This area is approximately 1 5cm from the periareolar scar  The remainder of the parenchyma consists primarily of grossly unremarkable tan yellow adipose tissue without other focal abnormalities  Representative sections of the specimen are submitted are follows  Section Code   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Periareolar scar  entirely blocked out  from superior to inferior   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest radial skin margin with respect to the periareolar scar  superior   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest radial skin margin with respect to the periareolar scar  inferior   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the second scar  from superior to inferior   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections