terior region which measures approximately 1 6cm in maximal dimension  Representative sections of this region are submitted into cassettes L N  Serial sectioning of the breast parenchyma surrounding the implant reveals a diffuse firm and white nodularity to the breast parenchyma with scattered calcification  The surface of the implant is white yellow  and focally calcified and firm  A representative section of a focally brown and firm nodular region at 2 o clock is submitted into cassette O  A focal region at approximately 8 o clock in the specimen shows a bulbous protrusion of the breast implant without any adjacent reaction in the fibrofatty breast parenchyma  A representative section of the unremarkable breast parenchyma at 9 o clock is submitted into cassette P  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fragment of fibrofatty and lymphoid tissue with multiple enlarged lymph nodes  the largest grossly measuring 1 6cm in maximal dimension  Representative individual candidate lymph nodes are submitted into cassettes Q W  Resident  PAUL MICHAELS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT  PART B  LEFT AXILLARY CONTENTS , Unchecked.
