s General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  09 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 14 10 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast lumpectomy   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm fibrofatty breast which has a short suture designating anterior  long suture designating lateral and a bowtie designating cephalad  The anterior aspect is blue inked  the posterior is black inked  the cephalad is green inked  the inferior is yellow inked  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm well delineated tan white gritty lesion  which comes to within 0 8cm of the superior  1 0cm of the anterior  1 5cm of the posterior lateral  inferior  2 0cm of the medial margins  Radiating from the lesion is up to 2 0cm of dense white fibrous tissue  which abuts the inferior and posterior margins  Located within 1 0cm anterior to the lesion is a 0 3cm well delineated white focus  which comes to within 1 0cm of the superior margin  Remaining parenchyma is predominantly yellow lobulated fatty tissue  Representative sections are submitted sequentially from medial to lateral as follows  SECTION CODES  A  fibrous tissue away from tumor to include posterior aspect  B C  tumor to superior anterior margin to include the white foci in C  D  fibrous tissue adjacent to tumor to inferior posterior and inferior margins  E  tumor to include adjacent fibrous tissue to posterior margins  F  uninvolved thin fibrous tissue to include anterior margin  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  primary sentinel node 799   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm tan pink rubbery lymph node  which is bisected to reveal a tan pink