DIZATION Addendum     RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block B   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 to chromosome 17 signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  08 AUG 03 at 17 08 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast   consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm piece of yellow tan fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is firm and somewhat rubbery on palpation  The specimen is inked black and serially sectioned to reveal firm  tan white tissue admixed with softer yellow adipose tissue  The specimen is taken entirely in cassettes A C  Resident  MINDY J  HULL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Checked.
