cimen  The cavity abuts the lateral  anterior  and posterior margin and measures 0 5cm from the medial margin  and 0 6cm from the superior margin  and 0 8cm from the inferior margin  There are white fibrous bands extending from the biopsy cavity towards the superior margin in focal regions  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of biopsy cavity to closest margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial margin  radially sectioned   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral margin  radially sectioned   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Section away from biopsy cavity  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin superior one half   are four unoriented fragments of breast tissue measuring 4 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm in aggregate  Sectioning reveals unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and   inferior   are two unoriented fragments of breast parenchyma measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm in aggregate  A REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE surface region on the larger tissue fragment is firm  pink and tan  consistent with biopsy cavity  This specimen is sectioned to reveal unremarkable breast parenchyma  The entire specimen is submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Colleen A Lamb M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Colleen A Lamb M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL MARGIN  SUPERIOR ONE HALF   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL MARGIN INFERIOR ONE HALF   EXCISION , Unchecked.
