ly submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Adriana Dionigi Corben M D   Electronically signed on Tuesday May 26   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 10 28 26AM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Breast  Left  Inferior Margin   Excision PART B  Breast  Left  Anterior Margin   Excision  report_end  , Unchecked.
