t number  and  final margin right breast superior half of cavity   is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm aggregate of tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue with cautery artifacts  The entire specimen is submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final margin right breast inferior half of cavity   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue  submitted in toto as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  additional inferior   lateral tissue right breast   are three unoriented fragments of tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  inked black  serially sectioned and submitted in toto as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE ADDENDUM NOTE  An additional level   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   examined shows an additional axillary lymph node which is negative for tumor  bringing the total number of negative nodes to 17 in the current specimen  Additional immunohistochemical stains  myosin and p63  performed on the additional inferior lateral tissue specimen  part E  show additional scattered myoepithelial cells in the atypical focus  further supporting the benign interpretation  Addendum  1 by Kristina Braaten M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   DISSECTION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL SUPERIOR MARGIN   EXCISION PART D  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL INFERIOR MARGIN   EXCISION PART E  BREAST   RIGHT  INFERIOR LATERAL ADDITIONAL TISSUE   EXCISIO  report_end  , Unchecked.
