ATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 8cm portion of gray white to tan yellow fibroadipose tissue with a short black stitch designating the superior  and a long black stitch the lateral margin  The specimen is partially surfaced along the superficial aspect by an unremarkable REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm gray tan skin ellipse  The posterior margin is inked black  the anterior blue  the superior green  and the inferior yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from lateral to medial to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm hemorrhagic cavity along the medial portion of the specimen which comes to 0 1cm of the medial margin and communicates with the anterior superior margin  The cavity is surrounded by dense  focally indurated gray white fibrous tissue with extensive tan yellow discoloration consistent with fat necrosis  The surrounding fibrous area focally abuts the inferior and anterior superior margin  Surrounding the cavity along the lateral aspect is a focal tan yellow gritty area  Arising 1 7cm lateral to the cavity is a well defined REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm soft tan pink area which comes to 0 5cm of the closest posterior superior margin  Arising 1 3cm lateral to the tan pink area is a poorly delineated REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm focally hemorrhagic  diffusely indurated area with diffuse tan yellow foci consistent with fat necrosis  This area comes to 0 3cm of the closest superior margin  Along the anterior inferior aspect of this area is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm indurated focus which comes to 0 3cm of the inferior  and 0 4cm of the anterior  1 6cm of the posterior  and 1 8cm of the superior margin  The remaining cut surface shows white fibrous tissue with no other discrete lesions or other gross abnormalities  Representative sections are submitted from lateral to medial as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Hemorrhagic cavity along medial half of specimen with surrounding fibrous tissue to closest margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Focally gritty f